<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot a student bus and a school bus in Sinaloa, targeting civilians, while federal forces seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. In Florida, a Sinaloa Cartel cocaine pipeline into the Tampa Bay area was busted, leading to multiple arrests and a press conference announcing the dismantling of the drug ring. Mexican bishops have urged authorities to search for a missing priest in Sinaloa, and a priest was reported missing in the same state. The United States is offering drone forensics tools to help trace cartel operators in Mexico. There were 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxONkpsLVl2Y3ZPZVhxVF9lNTJaSUE2djlRZlFiaUdpWEY4alEtWkR0cW1oSFJQLVFYOWhiS1V5Um9fWDF0SG1tSWZVdnN2VTJjei1JWlM5ZHVUeV9Yb0QzTE1faDJCNVp5dW5odFhMaEg4cXJxMDNURHNLN1NaX1oxZ3pFcEd1U19kVU1XNnB2RkpWTkwxT0hMaTNCLUZtNDVNZFVaYjBtOHc5TEs4blJrSDd2QzdyaTNzYnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Florida Politics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KMTR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WINK News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQZ0hEc3VienlVbzZzR21Kd29nMHdoWDFJWHpLQzJub3BnZVFERjlzSlpsa3hHbXQ2TlJxdzZnQzBMdVh0aHBkVjJTaUNNc0IwSS1UZHNuRF9mM29JUDVZVHNfNXQtekNRWkJNV1JIVVl0YzE5d29CNGZyTFpHSkJfbXZOcl9raEg2TWQ0?oc=5&quot;&gt;News 9&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 13 Tampa Bay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQaks5Um04c25NSE1CV2NmZ0JCVWxsVF9QQ1YxU3JxLWNZMDMxclYyQ3Bhb0pzdkw2X2lhaVNTYldHT2NheGplNlJpRDhSWXlFd1VscFJMVEdZTDNIQklocWdZcTVoX0NVMmdGWmFQNlU0VG0tRENsdy14LUlNV1lFaHg5M1VDdEdyTEFhZExiRU1nbnN